## Reference-use caution

The supplied persona responses included a number of incomplete, corrupted or explicitly unverified citations. Those should not be transferred into a manuscript without checking PubMed, the Cochrane Library, NICE, NHS England or the publisher’s record. In particular, evidence for virtual wards, urgent community response, SDEC, AI, social prescribing, digital triage, control rooms and environmental interventions should be cited using intervention- and population-specific studies rather than generic policy documents.